---
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
import { Alert } from "astro-ink";
---
<Base title="Alert">
  <div class="docs-page">
    <h1>Alert</h1>
    <p class="docs-lede">
      Contextual feedback for an action or a state change. Renders with
      <code>role="alert"</code> so assistive tech announces it.
    </p>

    <h2>Variants</h2>
    <div class="docs-example" style="display: grid;">
      <span class="docs-example-label" aria-hidden="true">Variants</span>
      <Alert><strong>Heads up.</strong> This is an informational message.</Alert>
      <Alert variant="success"><strong>Saved.</strong> Your changes are live.</Alert>
      <Alert variant="warning"><strong>Careful.</strong> This cannot be undone later.</Alert>
      <Alert variant="danger"><strong>Failed.</strong> The request was rejected.</Alert>
    </div>
    <pre class="docs-code"><code>&lt;Alert&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Heads up.&lt;/strong&gt; This is an informational message.&lt;/Alert&gt;
&lt;Alert variant="success"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Saved.&lt;/strong&gt; Your changes are live.&lt;/Alert&gt;
&lt;Alert variant="warning"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Careful.&lt;/strong&gt; This cannot be undone later.&lt;/Alert&gt;
&lt;Alert variant="danger"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Failed.&lt;/strong&gt; The request was rejected.&lt;/Alert&gt;</code></pre>

    <h2>Dismissible</h2>
    <div class="docs-example" style="display: grid;">
      <span class="docs-example-label" aria-hidden="true">Dismissible</span>
      <Alert variant="info" dismissible>Click the close button to remove this alert.</Alert>
    </div>
    <pre class="docs-code"><code>&lt;Alert variant="info" dismissible&gt;
  Click the close button to remove this alert.
&lt;/Alert&gt;</code></pre>

    <h2>Styles: filled and outline</h2>
    <div class="docs-example" style="display: grid;">
      <span class="docs-example-label" aria-hidden="true">Styles: filled and outline</span>
      <Alert variant="success" style="filled"><strong>Saved.</strong> Filled style, white text.</Alert>
      <Alert variant="danger" style="outline"><strong>Failed.</strong> Outline style, transparent body.</Alert>
    </div>
    <pre class="docs-code"><code>&lt;Alert variant="success" style="filled"&gt;...&lt;/Alert&gt;
&lt;Alert variant="danger" style="outline"&gt;...&lt;/Alert&gt;</code></pre>

    <h2>Listening for dismissal</h2>
    <p>Dismissing dispatches a bubbling <code>ink:alert:dismiss</code> event from the alert root:</p>
    <pre class="docs-code"><code>document.addEventListener("ink:alert:dismiss", (event) =&gt; &#123;
  console.log("alert dismissed", event.target);
&#125;);</code></pre>
    <p>
      Alerts rendered after page load (client-side HTML) are wired by calling
      <code>window.Ink.init(root)</code>.
    </p>

    <h2>Props</h2>
    <table class="docs-table">
      <thead>
        <tr><th>Prop</th><th>Type</th><th>Default</th><th>Description</th></tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td><code>variant</code></td><td><code>info | success | warning | danger</code></td><td><code>info</code></td><td>Semantic color.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>style</code></td><td><code>tint | filled | outline</code></td><td><code>tint</code></td><td>Filled uses white text on the semantic color (AA in the default theme).</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>dismissible</code></td><td><code>boolean</code></td><td><code>false</code></td><td>Shows a close button that removes the alert.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>role</code></td><td><code>string</code></td><td><code>alert</code></td><td>ARIA role. Use <code>status</code> for less urgent announcements.</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>

    <h2>Theming</h2>
    <pre class="docs-code"><code>:root &#123;
  --ink-alert-radius: 0;   /* square alerts */
&#125;</code></pre>

    <h2>Accessibility</h2>
    <ul class="docs-list">
      <li><code>role="alert"</code> announces the content when it appears dynamically. For static alerts rendered in the page source, pass <code>role="status"</code> to avoid an unnecessary announcement on load.</li>
      <li>The close button has <code>aria-label="Dismiss alert"</code> and is keyboard operable.</li>
      <li>Variant color is paired with the border and background, never color alone.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</Base>
